---
// What We Do / Services Section
---

<section id="services" class="relative isolate py-[92px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:section">
  <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:container">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-[720px] text-left" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:header">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:eyebrow">
        <span class="w-4 h-[2px] bg-[#94e760]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:4ny1y8"></span>
        <span class="text-[#94e760] text-[13.6px] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:4ny1y7">
          What we do
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-[36px] font-extrabold text-[#eef3f7] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-1.1px] mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:h2">
        Everything your business needs to stay connected.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#9fb1c2] text-[17.28px] leading-[28.51px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:p">
        Voice, data, internet, and IT — designed, provisioned, and supported by one local team.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 6 Services Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-[24px] mt-[48px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:grid">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Hosted VoIP -->
      <div class="bg-white/[0.035] border border-white/[0.09] rounded-[16px] p-[32px] hover:border-[#94e760]/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-1">
        <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:p9g3e3">
          <div class="bg-[#94e760]/12 text-[#94e760] w-12 h-12 rounded-[11px] flex items-center justify-center mb-5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:p9g3e4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-[18.24px] font-bold text-[#eef3f7] mb-2.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:bvanrx">Hosted VoIP</h3>
          <p class="text-[#9fb1c2] text-[15.36px] leading-[25px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:amfv7s">
            A full cloud phone system with multi-location extension dialing, auto-attendants, and voicemail-to-email — no on-site PBX to buy or maintain.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Tailored Solutions -->
      <div class="bg-white/[0.035] border border-white/[0.09] rounded-[16px] p-[32px] hover:border-[#94e760]/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-2">
        <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:p9g3e5">
          <div class="bg-[#94e760]/12 text-[#94e760] w-12 h-12 rounded-[11px] flex items-center justify-center mb-5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:8cm2h1">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-[18.24px] font-bold text-[#eef3f7] mb-2.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:bvanry">Tailored Solutions</h3>
          <p class="text-[#9fb1c2] text-[15.36px] leading-[25px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:amfv7t">
            No two businesses run the same. We design and build a communications and IT system around how yours actually works — not a one-size-fits-all package.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Business Internet & Fiber -->
      <div class="bg-white/[0.035] border border-white/[0.09] rounded-[16px] p-[32px] hover:border-[#94e760]/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-3">
        <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:8cm2h0">
          <div class="bg-[#94e760]/12 text-[#94e760] w-12 h-12 rounded-[11px] flex items-center justify-center mb-5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:8cm2gz">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.111 16.404a5.5 5.5 0 017.778 0M12 20h.01m-7.08-7.071c3.904-3.905 10.236-3.905 14.141 0M1.394 9.393c5.857-5.857 15.355-5.857 21.213 0" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-[18.24px] font-bold text-[#eef3f7] mb-2.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:bvanrz">Business Internet & Fiber</h3>
          <p class="text-[#9fb1c2] text-[15.36px] leading-[25px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:amfv7u">Dedicated high-speed connectivity — up to 5 Gbps on fiber — built for business uptime, not best-effort. Redundant options available.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Virtual Fax (FaxBridge) -->
      <div class="bg-white/[0.035] border border-white/[0.09] rounded-[16px] p-[32px] hover:border-[#94e760]/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-4">
        <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:8cm2gy">
          <div class="bg-[#94e760]/12 text-[#94e760] w-12 h-12 rounded-[11px] flex items-center justify-center mb-5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:8cm2gx">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-[18.24px] font-bold text-[#eef3f7] mb-2.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:bvans0">Virtual Fax (FaxBridge)</h3>
          <p class="text-[#9fb1c2] text-[15.36px] leading-[25px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:amfv7v">
            Send and receive faxes by email and web — no machine, no dedicated line. Reliable and compliant for healthcare, legal, and finance.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Managed IT -->
      <div class="bg-white/[0.035] border border-white/[0.09] rounded-[16px] p-[32px] hover:border-[#94e760]/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-5">
        <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:8cm2gv">
          <div class="bg-[#94e760]/12 text-[#94e760] w-12 h-12 rounded-[11px] flex items-center justify-center mb-5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:8cm2gu">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-[18.24px] font-bold text-[#eef3f7] mb-2.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:bvans1">Managed IT</h3>
          <p class="text-[#9fb1c2] text-[15.36px] leading-[25px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:amfv7w">
            Network management, security, and responsive support from a local team — so your technology just works and someone's always accountable.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 6: 5G Failover -->
      <div class="bg-white/[0.035] border border-white/[0.09] rounded-[16px] p-[32px] hover:border-[#94e760]/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:card-6">
        <div data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:8cm2gt">
          <div class="bg-[#94e760]/12 text-[#94e760] w-12 h-12 rounded-[11px] flex items-center justify-center mb-5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:8cm2gs">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-[18.24px] font-bold text-[#eef3f7] mb-2.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:bvans2">5G Failover</h3>
          <p class="text-[#9fb1c2] text-[15.36px] leading-[25px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Services.astro:amfv8i">
            Automatic wireless backup keeps you online when the wired line goes down. Your phones keep ringing and your business keeps running.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
